# Status transitions are NOT MCP tools — Important Rule 3 (agents/zensu-plm.md:179).
# Agent must direct the user to the Zensu REST API endpoint, and must NOT call update_feature for the status change.
# Negative asserts target tool-call shape (parens or "with") rather than bare co-occurrence,
# so benign prose like "update_feature does not support status" or its reversed-order form
# ("the status transition is not supported by update_feature") passes through.
(REST|API|endpoint|HTTP)
(status|transition|released)
!update_feature\s*\(
!update_feature\s+with
